==Trivia==
===Origin===
*All of this card's {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} illustrations were first featured on {{TCG ID|Paldea Evolved|Chien-Pao ex|61}} from the {{TCG|Paldea Evolved}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-B}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|SVP Promo|Chien-Pao ex|30}}, one of the {{TCG|SVP Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Icicle''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Snorunt|37}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.

